# GitHub Scrum board
Board: Project 1 "QA-lab URL Review" (https://github.com/orgs/carlosandmunoz-hq/projects/1), repo `kaanmuar/kaanmuar.github.io`. Columns: Backlog, Next, Design, Dev, QA, Stg, Prod, Done. Board chores: `scripts/ticket.sh` (`new`, `bug`, `design`, `move`, `child`, `done`, `log`).

- **Ticket every piece of work.** Find it, or `scripts/ticket.sh new "<title>" <area> dev`. Move as work moves; cite in the PR body.
- **Findings while developing are their own issues**, even if fixed in the same PR. `scripts/ticket.sh bug …`; `--dry-run` first for dupes (#2969).
- URL-review failure-cause fixes: add a `FIXES` row in `functions/url-review-failures.js`.
- **Design deliverables:** `scripts/ticket.sh design <ticket> "Design: ..." "<decisions, paths, live link>"`; Done when shipped.
- GitHub API/CI budget details: see `gh-budget` rule (auto-attaches on ticket/CI scripts).
